{"seq":5,"slug":"devops-containerization","title":"DevOps 与容器化","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization","rating":{"composite":4.22,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.28,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":2}},"introMarkdown":"# DevOps 与容器化 简介\n\nDevOps 是一种将开发（Development）与运维（Operations）紧密结合的工程文化和实践体系，而容器化技术则是实现 DevOps 理念的核心基础设施。从 Docker 的出现彻底改变了软件的打包与分发方式，到 Kubernetes 成为云原生时代的事实标准编排平台，再到 CI/CD 流水线实现了从代码提交到生产部署的全自动化——这些技术共同构成了现代软件交付的技术栈。\n\n本知识库面向希望系统掌握容器化与 DevOps 工程实践的开发者和运维工程师。无论你是刚接触 Docker 的后端开发者、正在落地 Kubernetes 的平台工程师，还是希望优化 CI/CD 流水线的技术负责人，这里都将为你提供从基础概念到生产实践的完整知识体系。\n\n全书共分五个章节，覆盖从容器基础到生产运维的完整知识体系：\n\n第一章**Docker 基础**从容器与虚拟机的本质区别出发，深入 Dockerfile 编写最佳实践、镜像管理策略以及容器网络模型，帮助你建立扎实的容器化基础。\n\n第二章**Docker Compose**聚焦多容器应用的本地编排，涵盖 Compose 文件的完整语法解析、多服务编排模式、数据卷持久化方案以及基于 Compose 的开发工作流。\n\n第三章**Kubernetes 核心**深入集群架构与核心概念，系统讲解 Pod、Deployment、Service、Ingress 等关键资源对象，以及 ConfigMap 和 Secret 的配置管理。\n\n第四章**CI/CD 流水线**围绕持续集成与持续部署展开，包括流水线设计模式、GitHub Actions 深度实践、制品与镜像仓库管理以及蓝绿部署、金丝雀发布等部署策略。\n\n第五章**监控与运维**讨论生产环境的可观测性体系，涵盖日志收集与分析、指标监控与告警、基础设施即代码以及事故响应流程。\n\n建议按照章节顺序学习。如果你已有 Docker 使用经验，可以从第二章 Compose 或第三章 Kubernetes 开始；如果你主要关注交付效率，可以直接进入第四章 CI/CD 流水线。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"docker-fundamentals","title":"Docker 基础","docCount":4,"url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"container-vs-vm","title":"容器与虚拟机","url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-fundamentals/container-vs-vm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dockerfile-best-practices","title":"Dockerfile 最佳实践","url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-fundamentals/dockerfile-best-practices"},{"seq":3,"slug":"image-management","title":"镜像管理","url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-fundamentals/image-management"},{"seq":4,"slug":"container-networking","title":"容器网络","url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-fundamentals/container-networking"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"docker-compose","title":"Docker Compose","docCount":4,"url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-compose","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"compose-file-anatomy","title":"Compose 文件解析","url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-compose/compose-file-anatomy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-service-orchestration","title":"多服务编排","url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-compose/multi-service-orchestration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"volumes-and-persistence","title":"数据卷与持久化","url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-compose/volumes-and-persistence"},{"seq":4,"slug":"development-workflows","title":"开发工作流","url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-compose/development-workflows"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"kubernetes-essentials","title":"Kubernetes 核心","docCount":4,"url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/kubernetes-essentials","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"architecture-and-concepts","title":"架构与概念","url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/kubernetes-essentials/architecture-and-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pods-and-deployments","title":"Pod 与 Deployment","url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/kubernetes-essentials/pods-and-deployments"},{"seq":3,"slug":"services-and-ingress","title":"Service 与 Ingress","url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/kubernetes-essentials/services-and-ingress"},{"seq":4,"slug":"configmaps-and-secrets","title":"ConfigMap 与 Secret","url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/kubernetes-essentials/configmaps-and-secrets"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"ci-cd-pipelines","title":"CI/CD 流水线","docCount":4,"url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pipeline-design-patterns","title":"流水线设计模式","url":"/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines/pipeline-design-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"github-actions-deep-di